        <td><div class="blockDistinct">
          <div align="center">
            <div align="center"><strong><font color="#FFFFFF" face="Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"><span class="style6">Attention: All Affiliate Markerters & Online Income Seekers, Find Out The Secret Weapon To Huge Commissions To</span></font><span class="style6"><font color="#FFFFFF" face="Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif">day.</font></span></strong></div>
            <h2 align="center"><font size="+2" face="Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif">&quot;Ready For Access To a Brand New   Program That Generates <br />
              Amazing Product Review Sites, In Just 5 Minutes Or   Less... &quot;</font></h2>
            <p><font color="#500C0D" size="4" face="Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"><strong>** Affiliate News Flash ** </strong></font></p>
            </div>
          <div style="width: 100%; border: 3px dashed black; background-color:#FFFF00"> 
            <div align="center"><font size="3" face="Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"> <strong>Recently, Super Affiliate HomeStead (clickbank username) has generated a WHOPPING <span class="style3">$3525.36</span> from one SINGLE review site geared toward hosting companies. </strong></font> <font size="3"><strong><font face="Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif">There are several Hosting Offers on clickbank alone, and the opportunity for creating review sites are endless.</font>
              </strong>
              </font></div>
            </div>
          <p class="right"> <font face="Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"><a href="#header" title="Top Of page">Top <img src="http://www.automaticreviews.com/images/arrow.up.gif"    alt="" width="7" height="8" border="0" /></a> </font></p>
          <p align="center" class="right"><span class="style8">&quot;What if I told you I had not only a method but a fool proof way to create an income online &amp; the tools to do it&quot;</span></p>
        </div>
          <div class="blockDistinct">
            <h2> <font face="Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"><a name="analiza" id="analiza"><img src="http://www.automaticreviews.com/images/box.jpg"    width="139" height="166" align="right" />From:</a> <small>Jeffrey Desjardins</small></font></h2>
            <p class="style4">Ok, Your wanting to earn <strong>MORE</strong> as an affiliate marketer right? or your seeking to create an income online? </p>
            <p align="left" class="style4">That makes two of us. I have to admit, it's always been like winning the lotto for me when I get checks in from the affiliate networks. Actually, I think every affiliate marketer's goal is to see BIGGER &amp; BIGGER dollar amounts appear on checks as they come rolling in every month like<em> clockwork</em>.</p>
            <p class="style4">However, for those of you who are like me, we know it's easier said than done. You could have the perfect product that your promoting, but if you are not promoting it properly you are losing a LOT of commissions. Traffic isn't cheap especially if your using adwords or PPC advertising in general, you'll want to make sure every dollar you spend is converting.</p>
            <p class="style4">&nbsp;</p>
            <p class="style4"><strong>But wait</strong>! What if we can find a way to virtually eliminate online competitors and keep our punters all to ourselves? Promote our products in an environment that allows punters to compare numerous offers/services with there guard down. </p>
            <p></p>
            <div align="center"><font face="Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"><img src="http://www.automaticreviews.com/images/covercopy.jpg"    /><img src="http://www.automaticreviews.com/images/100.jpg"    /></font></div>
            <div></div>
            <p align="center"><font face="Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"><strong>Review Site Generator v.2.0 &quot;Easily Generates Amazing Review Sites in a matter of minutes&quot;</strong></font></p>
            <p class="right"> <font face="Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"><a href="#header" title="Top Of page">Top <img src="http://www.automaticreviews.com/images/arrow.up.gif"    alt="" width="7" height="8" border="0" /></a> </font></p>
          </div>
          <div  style="padding-top:10px;"></div>
          <div class="blockDistinct">
            <h2> 
              <div align="center"><font face="Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"><a name="analiza" id="analiza"><strong>Check out the software in action, in this demo video...</strong> </a></font></div> 
              </h2>
            <div align="center">
              <font face="Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif">
              <object classid="clsid:d27cdb6e-ae6d-11cf-96b8-444553540000" width="640" height="498" codebase="http://active.macromedia.com/flash7/cabs/ swflash.cab#version=9,0,28,0">
                <param name="src" value="newvid.swf"/>
                <param name="bgcolor" value="#1a1a1a"/>
                <param name="quality" value="best"/>
