              </object>
              </font></div>
            <p><font face="Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif">As you can see this software <strong>makes the process of creating your own affiliate review pages so much faster and easier.</strong> You just follow the steps, fill in some required information, click 'generate' and out pops your review page.</font></p>
            <p align="center"><font color="red" face="Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"><strong>&quot;So you wanna know how the SUPER affiliates are generating &quot;six figure incomes&quot;</strong></font></p>
            <p align="center"><font face="Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"><strong>Launching Review Sites on as many niches as they can...
              
              
              
              this program makes that easy and painless</strong></font></p>
            <p><font face="Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif">If you want a new way to efficiently <em>boost</em> your affiliate income, then you should get this program right now and start using it today.</font></p>
            <p class="right"> <font face="Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"><a href="#header" title="Top Of page">Top <img src="http://www.automaticreviews.com/images/arrow.up.gif"    alt="" width="7" height="8" border="0" /></a> </font></p>
          </div>
          <div  style="padding-top:10px;"></div>
          <div class="blockDistinct">
            <h2> 
              <div align="center"><font face="Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"><a name="analiza" id="analiza">The SECRET is in the Affiliate &quot;Review&quot; </a></font></div> 
              </h2>
            <p><font face="Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"> You see, Affiliate Review sites give people interested in the product a real-life look at how it works - without putting on the high-pressure, hyped-up sales tactics.</font></p>
            <p><font face="Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif">When someone reads a &quot;review&quot;, they let their guard down. They're more easily persuaded to keep reading and finding out about the product</font></p>
            <p><font face="Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif">It's no secret that people don't like being "sold" to, but rather being recommended to buy from a friend whom they can trust. When it comes to marketing online, the next best thing to a friend's recommendation is affiliate review sites.</font></p>
            <p class="right"> <font face="Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"><a href="#header" title="Top Of page">Top <img src="http://www.automaticreviews.com/images/arrow.up.gif"    alt="" width="7" height="8" border="0" /></a> </font></p>
          </div>
          <div  style="padding-top:10px;"></div>
          <div class="blockDistinct">
            <h2> 
              <div align="center"><font face="Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"><a name="analiza" id="analiza">&quot;Be The Good Guy, Be The Informed Friend&quot;</a></font></div> 
              </h2>
            <p><font face="Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"> We know that having the ability for us to review a product that someone else has tried is far more powerful than trying to convince someone it's worth the money to take the chance and try it, RIGHT? so we take a different approach and offer the punter the opportunity to review serveral offers/services in an enviroment that keeps them from looking over there shoulder for a sales pitch.</font></p>
            <p><font face="Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif">Sounds like a lot of work? Well it's definitely not as easy as just grabbing your affiliate links and promoting them. However, thanks to the new <strong>&quot;Review Site Generator V2.0&quot;</strong> The guess work is taking out with ease.</font></p>
            <p class="right"> <font face="Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"><a href="#header" title="Top Of page">Top <img src="http://www.automaticreviews.com/images/arrow.up.gif"    alt="" width="7" height="8" border="0" /></a> </font></p>
          </div>
          <div  style="padding-top:10px;"></div>
          <div class="blockDistinct">
            <h2> 
              <div align="center"><font face="Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"><a name="analiza" id="analiza">In just a few easy steps, this Program</a></font> </div> 
              </h2>
            <ul id="templatetypes">
              <li><font face="Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif">Generates a review style site given you the options for various layouts and colors!</font></li>
              <li><font face="Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif">Fill in the blanks, click &quot;Generate&quot; and your done!</font></li>
              <li><font face="Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif">Upload your images directly in the program and your whole site is ready in minutes!</font></li>
              <li><font face="Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif">Easy to use for both &quot;newbies&quot; and advance marketers.. </font></li>
              <li><font face="Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif">Uses a proven template, that has a ROI.</font></li>
              <li><font face="Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif">Allows you to be more creative then ever before with it's built in interface.</font></li>
              <li><font face="Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif">The ability to create a review site on 4 different niches within 10 mins MAX.</font></li>
              <li><font face="Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif">Can be used for affiliate products as well as your own products.</font></li>
            </ul>
            <p></p>
            <p><font face="Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"><strong>And lots more. </strong></font></p>
            <p class="right"> <font face="Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"><a href="#header" title="Top Of page">Top <img src="http://www.automaticreviews.com/images/arrow.up.gif"    alt="" width="7" height="8" border="0" /></a> </font></p>
          </div>
          <div  style="padding-top:10px;"></div>
          <div class="blockDistinct">
            <h2> 
