            <p></p>
            <p><font face="Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif">As you can see there are 4 layout options available to choose from allowing you to have more flexability with style. Also keeping things fresh for launching serveral sites on various products or services. </font></p>
            <p class="right"> <font face="Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"><a href="#header" title="Top Of page">Top <img src="http://www.automaticreviews.com/images/arrow.up.gif"    alt="" width="7" height="8" border="0" /></a> </font></p>
          </div>
          <div  style="padding-top:10px;"></div>
          <div class="blockDistinct">
            <h2> 
              <div align="center"><font face="Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"><a name="analiza" id="analiza">So How Much Will It Cost You?</a></font></div> 
              </h2>
            <p><font face="Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif">Now, The biggest question at hand is what is this program going to cost me, right? </font></p>
            <p><font face="Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif">JUST <strong>$89.95 </strong> For a limited time! </font></p>
            <p><font face="Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"> Yes, <strong>for the price of a Night Out</strong> you will get instant access to this amazing software that could literally help you double or even triple your affiliate sales. </font></p>
            <font face="Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"><br />
            <p><strong>&quot;</strong>In my own Venture through the Affiliate Marketing World I have noticed something, and that is that all the succesfull marketers don't run just one site but countless sites and if every one can produce even small amounts... guess what, your laughing all the way to the bank<strong>&quot;</strong> </p>
            <br />
            <p> So if you're serious about <strong>getting MORE affiliate sales</strong> from your promotions on autopilot everyday, click the &quot;Buy Now&quot; button below. If you need to justify the expense, skip a night out once this month and the software is paid for. </p>
